  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program development objective is to improve economic management by ensuring that macroeconomic sector strategies are translated into programs and projects. More specifically, this project aims to mainly i) improve aid coordination and channeling external resources to priority areas; and (ii) strengthen the project cycle to providing a framework within which project preparation, implementation and monitoring can occur.</narrative>
